# Canonical author names. Several members have committed under more than one
# git display name from different machines; without this file `git shortlog`
# and `git log --author` split one person's history across two identities and
# understate their contribution.
#
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email>  Other Name <same@email>

hasini <hasinirg7@gmail.com> hashinn <hasinirg7@gmail.com>
